    "description": "# RandomQuote API\n\nRandomQuote API is a RESTful API for managing quotes, and retrieving random quotes\n\nThe collection is organized around the following resources:\n\n- Quotes — Quote management and random quote retrieval.\n    \n\nEach request contains its own documentation, including the endpoint, request parameters, request body, authentication requirements, and example responses.\n\n## Request Format\n\nRequests that send data to the API use JSON format unless otherwise specified.\n\n``` text\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n ```\n\n## Environment\n\nThe collection uses the `{{BASE_URL}}` variable to define the API base URL.\n\nThe base URL and other sensitive values are stored in the Postman environment and are not included in the public documentation.",
